			"notes": "This release performs the following changes:\n\n- The textures of TNT-based parts has been tweaked slightly\n- The Explosive modifier is now functional\n- The Dark Traveler modifier is now functional\n- The Get Lucky modifier has been renamed to \"From the Ashes\" to better fit its intended functionality\n  - This modifier does not yet function, though\n\nPlusTiC Reforged still only has a small number of features that were available in the original PlusTiC version. Please be patient as the mod is further developed!\n\nKnown Issues:\n\n- Some of the modifiers (traits) have been implemented only in name, but the effects have not been ported.\n- The handle material stats are not yet balanced, as Tinkers' Construct 3 changed the stats system. (Help wanted!)\n- The textures of materials have a low contrast, making the edges hard to see"
		},
